# Unit tests

Vitest. Web: Testing Library + `tests/setup.ts`. API: supertest against `createApp`. Map each Given/When/Then (AC) to a test.

Do not lower 100% thresholds in `tools/vitest-config`. Do not widen `coverage.exclude` without review.

```ts
// BAD
it('works', async () => { expect(true).toBe(true); });

// GOOD
it('rejects a second location with 409 LOCATION_LIMIT_V1', async () => {
  const res = await request(app).post('/tenancy/pharmacies/t/locations');
  expect(res.status).toBe(409);
});
```
